      <p><b>Vocational Education and Training</b><b> </b><b>Funding Laws Amendment Act 1996</b></p>
      <p>No. 73, 1996</p>
      <p>An Act to amend certain laws relating to vocational education and training, and for related purposes</p>
      <p>[Assented to <date date="1996-12-05">5 December 1996</date>]</p>
      <formula name="enacting">
        <p>The Parliament of Australia enacts:</p>
      </formula>
