        <content>
          <p><b>Schedule 2—Amendment of the Australian National Training Authority Act 1992</b></p>
          <p><b>1 </b><b>Paragraph 24(1)(c)</b></p>
          <p>Repeal the paragraph, substitute:</p>
          <p>(c) 5 other members.</p>
          <p><b>2 </b><b>Subsection 24(2)</b></p>
          <p>Omit “2 vacancies”, substitute “3 vacancies”</p>
          <p><b>3 </b><b>Subsections 36(3) and (5)</b></p>
          <p>Omit “3 members", substitute “4 members”.</p>
